OL,5,Aschool shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FSchools in the district will remain
OL,8,Fclosed today "due to the tragedy",
OL,9,Fofficials say
OL,11,FOregon's gun law strength is ranked
OL,12,F12th out of 50 states, according to
OL,13,Fadvocacy group Everytown for Gun Safety
OL,14,F- how strict are the state's gun laws?
OL,16,FBBC Verify looks at how common shooting
OL,17,Fincidents at US schools have become
OL,18,Fover the last 15 years
