OL,3,APalestinians and US journalist injured
OL,4,Aby Israeli settlers in West Bank
OL,5,Aharvest attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FDozens of masked settlers have attacked
OL,8,FPalestinians and set fire to cars and
OL,9,Folive trees during the annual olive
OL,10,Fharvest in the occupied West Bank.
OL,12,FA BBC team witnessed one of several
OL,13,Fattacks in farmland near the
OL,14,FPalestinian village of Abu Falah. A
OL,15,Flocal official said the attacks had
OL,16,Finjured 12 Palestinians, including four
OL,17,Fdual Palestinian American citizens. A
OL,18,Fforeign journalist was also among those
OL,19,Fhurt.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
