OL,3,APalestinians and US journalist injured
OL,4,Aby Israeli settlers in West Bank
OL,5,Aharvest attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FDriving into the area early in the
OL,8,Fmorning, we came across the first signs
OL,9,Fof the violence: a stream of cars
OL,10,Fcarrying wounded Palestinian olive
OL,11,Ffarmers racing out along the narrow
OL,12,Fstony track, piled high with olive
OL,13,Fpicking equipment, as smoke rose from
OL,14,Fseveral fires nearby.
OL,16,FThe bloodied face of Majdi Fheed peered
OL,17,Fout from the backseat of one car.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
