OL,3,AZelensky says Ukraine has right to
OL,4,Adefend itself after Trump calls latest
OL,5,Astrikes a 'disgrace'
OL,6,
OL,7,FZelensky, who has been angered by the
OL,8,Fdiesel deal, said he could not accept
OL,9,Fit, because a gas agreement could come
OL,10,Fnext. "If I don't stand up to this...
OL,11,Fwho else will?" he said at an EU summit
OL,12,Fin Brussels.
OL,14,FTensions between Washington and Kyiv
OL,15,Fhave escalated over the diesel deal and
OL,16,Fcurbs on Ukraine's battlefield
OL,17,Fsatellite network.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
